WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Cloudbreak, level 43. Hard difficulty in Midnight Summit.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
The climber crosses the lower decks, climbs ladders and jumps past moving fire hazards.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
The ascent continues through the middle decks and across a gap in the walkway.

00:18.000 --> 00:27.300
The climber reaches the upper ladders and jumps over rolling barrels toward the rescue beacon.

00:27.300 --> 00:31.000
Stage complete: 4,420 points. Six ladder climbs and 16 jumps.
